		Usage:     "manage certificate authority contexts",
		UsageText: "**step context** [global-flags] <subcommand> [arguments] [subcommand-flags]",
		Description: `**step context** command group provides facilities to manage certificate
authority contexts.

## EXAMPLES

'''
